  m_Name: Q12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "Animator Controller ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng th\u1EBF n\xE0o? Blend
    Tree l\xE0 g\xEC?"
  choices:
  - text: "Animator c\xF3 c\xE1c state v\xE0 transition. Blend Tree d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3
      smooth transition gi\u1EEFa walk v\xE0 run theo t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Bi\u1EBFt kh\xE1i ni\u1EC7m c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a
      bi\u1EBFt 2D blend tree."
  - text: "Animator d\xF9ng state machine v\u1EDBi transitions c\xF3 conditions.
      Parameters (float, bool, int, trigger) drive transitions. Blend Tree blend
      nhi\u1EC1u animation theo parameter \u2014 v\xED d\u1EE5 blend idle/walk/run
      theo Speed float, ho\u1EB7c 2D blend tree cho strafe movement. T\u1ED1t h\u01A1n
      code-switching animation th\u1EE7 c\xF4ng."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u state machine v\xE0 Blend Tree 1D/2D"
  - text: "Animator \u0111\u1EC3 control animation, t\xF4i d\xF9ng Play() v\xE0 CrossFade()
      ch\u1EE7 y\u1EBFu."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "D\xF9ng legacy API, ch\u01B0a hi\u1EC3u state machine."
  category: Unity
